    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d84">

                <pb facs="0130" n="118" sameAs="frus:frus1942v05/pg118"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.74/318: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Bolivia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Dawson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">La
                                Paz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1942-05-05T18:00:00-04:00">May 5, 1942—6 p.m.</date><lb/>[Received
                        8:12 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>294. Department’s 233, April 24.<anchor n="15" xml:id="d84-f1"/> Bolivian
                    Government has taken no steps to implement Rio Resolution XL despite efforts of
                    Legation. Communications with Axis powers and territory controlled by them are
                    in every case on the alert through<anchor n="16" xml:id="d84-f2"/> other
                    American Republics whose implementing of the resolution would accordingly have
                    the desired practical effect on messages from Bolivia. All America Cables has
                    received instructions from New York not to accept communications to Axis
                    countries except government messages.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dawson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d84-f1" n="15" xml:id="d84-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d84-f2" n="16" xml:id="d84-f2-content">
                <p>The apparent meaning of this sentence is indicated by substituting the words
                    “dependent upon” for the words “on the alert through.”</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
